sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Researcher as Researcher
participant ResearchDashboard as Boundary: ResearchDashboard
participant InferenceResultControl as Control: InferenceResultControl
participant DetectionResult as Entity: DetectionResult
Researcher->>ResearchDashboard: Request research records
ResearchDashboard->>InferenceResultControl: Authorize and apply filters
InferenceResultControl->>DetectionResult: Load result and model evidence
DetectionResult-->>InferenceResultControl: Return sanitized provenance
InferenceResultControl-->>ResearchDashboard: Format uncertainty metadata
ResearchDashboard-->>Researcher: Review record suitability
